      "title": "SSO Provisioning and Sync Stuck in Production (ANZ)",
      "description": "We are experiencing a critical issue with our SSO Integration Module in the production environment (ANZ region). Since approximately 08:00 AM local time, user provisioning has completely halted. The sync status is stuck and not progressing, affecting roughly 678 users who cannot access their accounts or have new hires onboarded. We need immediate assistance to unblock the sync process."
